# Git commits

When creating git commits for this project:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any other Cursor/agent co-author trailer to commit messages.
- Use plain commit messages only (title + body via HEREDOC); no `Signed-off-by` or co-author lines unless the user explicitly asks.
- If a hook or tool injects co-author metadata, warn the user rather than amending unless they request it.
